OL,3,AGovernment plans 'cot cams' in baby
OL,4,Awards after inquiry into deaths at Lucy
OL,5,ALetby's hospital
OL,6,
OL,7,FHealth Secretary Yvette Cooper says the
OL,8,Fgovernment will "urgently develop
OL,9,Fplans" to put live-streaming monitors
OL,10,Fon cots in neonatal wards
OL,12,FThe cameras were among a series of
OL,13,Frecommendations in the Thirlwall
OL,14,FInquiry, which examined the hospital
OL,15,Fwhere killer nurse Lucy Letby worked -
OL,16,Fhere's what else was suggested
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
