OL,3,AGovernment plans 'cot cams' in baby
OL,4,Awards after inquiry into deaths at Lucy
OL,5,ALetby's hospital
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe inquiry found some deaths at the
OL,8,FCountess of Chester Hospital could have
OL,9,Fbeen prevented, with chair Lady Justice
OL,10,FThirlwall saying there was a "complete
OL,11,Ffailure to protect babies" - key
OL,12,Ffindings from the report
OL,14,FLetby is serving 15 whole-life prison
OL,15,Fterms for murdering seven babies and
OL,16,Fattempting to murder seven more. She
OL,17,Fwas convicted in 2023 and has twice
OL,18,Fbeen denied permission to appeal
OL,19,Fagainst her convictions
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
