OL,3,AState pension likely to top #13,000 a
OL,4,Ayear as UK wage growth slows to 3.9%
OL,5,
OL,6,FLabour made a manifesto pledge to keep
OL,7,Fthe triple lock until 2029, however
OL,8,Feconomists have warned about the cost
OL,9,Fof the policy ahead of the Budget
OL,10,Falthough pensioner groups say many
OL,11,Fpeople still face poverty in old age.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
