OL,3,ADenmark says Russian warship fired
OL,4,Aflares at military helicopter
OL,5,
OL,6,FDenmark has accused a Russian warship
OL,7,Fof firing two emergency flares at one
OL,8,Fof its helicopters while it was
OL,9,Ftracking the vessel in the Baltic Sea.
OL,11,FThe Danish government has summoned the
OL,12,FRussian ambassador over the incident,
OL,13,Fwhich it said happened during a
OL,14,F"routine" monitoring operation on
OL,15,FMonday.
OL,17,FPrime Minister Mette Frederiksen
OL,18,Fbranded the Russian action "reckless"
OL,19,Fand said it was designed to "intimidate
OL,20,Fand divide".
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
